{"name": "Tank Havoc", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/96dfa86e9b221d7599105316572ba6f4.avif?t=1783781197\" width=\"1325\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Take control of unique tank operators, each built for a specific role on the battlefield.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Read the battlefield, know your strengths and weaknesses, and strike at the right moment to gain the advantage.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"4\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1743b5f30f11f11cc7e8739e0535040e.webp?t=1783781197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.poster.avif?t=1783781197\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.webm?t=1783781197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.mp4?t=1783781197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW YOU PLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every operator offers a different approach to combat. <br/>From fast scouts to heavy tanks, each playstyle requires different decisions, positioning, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Read the battlefield, know your strengths and weaknesses, and strike at the perfect moment to take the advantage.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"4\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1743b5f30f11f11cc7e8739e0535040e.webp?t=1783781197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.poster.avif?t=1783781197\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.webm?t=1783781197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.mp4?t=1783781197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TEAMPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work with your team to gain control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create openings, apply pressure, and coordinate attacks to break enemy defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Each operator has a role, and effective teamwork makes the difference.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"4\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1743b5f30f11f11cc7e8739e0535040e.webp?t=1783781197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"222\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.poster.avif?t=1783781197\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.webm?t=1783781197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.mp4?t=1783781197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PROGRESSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your tank and develop your operator over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjust your build, improve your capabilities, and adapt your playstyle to different situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Every match is an opportunity to refine your playstyle and push your limits.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"4\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1743b5f30f11f11cc7e8739e0535040e.webp?t=1783781197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.poster.avif?t=1783781197\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.webm?t=1783781197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.mp4?t=1783781197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Duels</strong> (1v1) - Face your opponent in <strong>direct combat</strong>. Pure skill, no distractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brawls</strong> (3v3) - <strong>Objective-based</strong> battles focused on object control and coordination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MOBA</strong> (4v4) - <strong>Larger battles</strong> with <strong>minion armies</strong>, and strategic objectives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Different modes, same goal - master your operator and win the fight.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"4\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1743b5f30f11f11cc7e8739e0535040e.webp?t=1783781197\" width=\"1560\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/e7776431c1e0fcab2e8e66102a294c05.avif?t=1783781197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Choose your operator, craft your loadout, and let the battlefield become a reflection of your strategy.</i></strong> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Tank Havoc is a top-down team-based multiplayer shooter. Play as unique tank operators, each with their own playstyle and character. Learn their strengths and weaknesses, then strike at the right moment to dominate PvP battles.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/9f60aa173e0eb1e59ccf33a5ae2b6f7e7c0bfcc7/header.jpg?t=1783781197", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Vehicular Combat", "Top-Down Shooter", "Tanks", "PvP", "MOBA", "Twin Stick Shooter"], "developers": "Mad Missile", "publishers": "Mad Missile", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3846960", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "11 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Pb_yc4JeAYc", "first_seen": 1773183600.0, "review_ra